fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266OLSHRDParameters","fragment":"\n\tGstH266OLSHRDParameters\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266OLSHRDParameters\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266OLSHRDParameters\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 OLS HDR parameters.\nindicates the temporal distance between the\nHRD output times of consecutive pictures in output order is constrained as\nspecified in this clause using the variable DpbOutputElementalInterval[n].\nindicates the temporal distance between the\nHRD output times of consecutive pictures in output order is constrained as\nspecified in this clause using the variable DpbOutputElementalInterval[n].\nspecifies the temporal distance between\nthe elemental units that specify the HRD output times of consecutive\npictures in output order.\nspecifies the HRD operational mode as specified\nin Annex C.\nsub layer nal GstH266SubLayerHRDParameters.\nsub layer vcl GstH266SubLayerHRDParameters.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 OLS HDR parameters.\nindicates the temporal distance between the\nHRD output times of consecutive pictures in output order is constrained as\nspecified in this clause using the variable DpbOutputElementalInterval[n].\nindicates the temporal distance between the\nHRD output times of consecutive pictures in output order is constrained as\nspecified in this clause using the variable DpbOutputElementalInterval[n].\nspecifies the temporal distance between\nthe elemental units that specify the HRD output times of consecutive\npictures in output order.\nspecifies the HRD operational mode as specified\nin Annex C.\nsub layer nal GstCodecParsers.H266SubLayerHRDParameters.\nsub layer vcl GstCodecParsers.H266SubLayerHRDParameters.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 OLS HDR parameters.\nindicates the temporal distance between the\nHRD output times of consecutive pictures in output order is constrained as\nspecified in this clause using the